            <title>1.1.73</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Quiz questions can now include relevant histology, clinical images, and diagrams from your lecture slides.</p><p>- Answer-revealing labels are covered, and images are checked for relevance and remaining answer clues. Unsuitable image questions are skipped.</p><p>- Relevant images from your local AnKing cards can supplement lecture images when Anki is connected. Open the source card after answering.</p><p>- Click quiz images to enlarge them. Generate New Questions to try the updated image checks.</p>]]></description>
